# Cloudflare Pages 응답 헤더 (GitHub Pages는 이 파일을 무시하므로 index.html 의 CSP 메타 태그가 기본 방어선이다)
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.mcsrvstat.us https://*.workers.dev; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()

/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, immutable
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, immutable
/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, must-revalidate
/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, must-revalidate
/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=60, must-revalidate

# 저장소 관리용 파일은 공개 사이트에서 숨긴다
/backend/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/scripts/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
